REEO is a continuation of BOOLR, a digital logic simulator originally authored by
Gees Brouwer (https://github.com/ggbrw).

The original source in this repository is licensed under GNU GPL version 3.
REEO modifications and new source code are distributed under GPL-3.0-only.
Original authorship and upstream history are preserved; product rebranding does
not imply authorship of all original code.

The original bundled font and icon assets are retained. Their respective authors
and licenses continue to apply; audit redistribution notices before store release.

Interface icons: Phosphor Icons (@phosphor-icons/core), MIT License.
The selected original SVGs and license are in public/icons/phosphor/.
Circuit symbols are REEO-authored vector paths, not Phosphor UI icons.

Arabic font: IBM Plex Sans Arabic, Copyright IBM Corp., SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Bundled from the Google Fonts google/fonts repository; font files and OFL.txt are
in public/fonts/ibm-plex-sans-arabic/. CSS unicode-range restricts these faces to
Arabic glyphs so existing Latin font stacks remain in use.
